TfNSW will be seeking Tenders from suitably qualified and experienced Tenderers for the provision of Detailed Design Services. The required services will be outlined in the Scope of Services and General Requirements document, which will form part of the RFT package once available for publication.
Conditions for participation: Respondents (either individually including subcontractors or in combination if a joint venture is proposed) will be required to hold registration under the Technical Services Registration Scheme (SCM8661) in all the following service categories:
o Complex Road Design;
o Standard Bridge Design;
o Drainage Investigation and Design (or subcontractor); and
o Estimating Services – General (or subcontractor)
